      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_system_02",
      "hash64": "2E948F3A4B50B386",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n把各种食材装进了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]野餐[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]口袋！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_01",
      "hash64": "64A882D93AB48EBD",
      "text": "我刚刚买的食材太多了，\\n你能不能拿走一些？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_02",
      "hash64": "64A87FD93AB489A4",
      "text": "要说野餐，\\n果然少不了三明治！\\r\\n试着用我给你的食材制作吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_06",
      "hash64": "64A87BD93AB482D8",
      "text": "要不要顺便加入我的野餐，\\n和宝可梦一起休息一下？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_03",
      "hash64": "64A880D93AB48B57",
      "text": "欢迎加入我的野餐，\\n要和宝可梦一起休息吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_04",
      "hash64": "64A87DD93AB4863E",
      "text": "你和你的宝可梦\\n都充满活力了呢！\\r\\n欢迎随时过来休息。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_01_05",
      "hash64": "64A87ED93AB487F1",
      "text": "要是累了的话，可不要勉强哦。\\n欢迎随时过来休息。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_01",
      "hash64": "B6B642BD7F6412CA",
      "text": "我包里的食材塞太多了！\\n分给你一些哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_02",
      "hash64": "B6B641BD7F641117",
      "text": "露天吃的三明治最好吃了！\\n试着用我分给你的食材制作吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_06",
      "hash64": "B6B63DBD7F640A4B",
      "text": "要不要就这样和我一起野餐，\\n稍微休息一下呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_03",
      "hash64": "B6B640BD7F640F64",
      "text": "要和我一起野餐，\\n稍微休息一下吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_04",
      "hash64": "B6B63FBD7F640DB1",
      "text": "你和你的宝可梦\\n都充满活力了呢！\\r\\n欢迎你随时再来休息哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_02_05",
      "hash64": "B6B63EBD7F640BFE",
      "text": "不要这么客气嘛～\\n那就欢迎你随时再来啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_01",
      "hash64": "638C6EC7903E8A3F",
      "text": "这里是桌台市和\\n深钵镇的正中心一带！\\c\\n吃完三明治，\\n就能继续加油冒险咯～！\\c\\n……为了让你也能继续加油，\\n我分给你一些食材吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_02",
      "hash64": "638C6FC7903E8BF2",
      "text": "对了，我听说这一带的岩壁动了，\\n不知道是不是真的～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_06",
      "hash64": "638C6BC7903E8526",
      "text": "为了哪怕岩壁动起来也不被吓到，\\n你来稍微休息一下吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_03",
      "hash64": "638C70C7903E8DA5",
      "text": "努力的劲头不够了？\\n你来稍微休息一下吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_04",
      "hash64": "638C69C7903E81C0",
      "text": "不论是人还是宝可梦，\\n要努力就必须休息才行！\\r\\n感到累了的话，记得再来哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_03_05",
      "hash64": "638C6AC7903E8373",
      "text": "这样啊！\\n不要太勉强哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_01",
      "hash64": "937E7EF1480603A4",
      "text": "坡道比想象中陡，\\n好累啊……\\c\\n这种时候就要吃东西\\n来让身心焕发活力！\\c\\n我分给你一些食材，\\n你也来焕发活力吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_02",
      "hash64": "937E81F1480608BD",
      "text": "要是肚子空空如也，\\n本来能努力的事情也努力不了啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_06",
      "hash64": "937E7DF1480601F1",
      "text": "旅行靠同伴，处世靠人情！\\n你也顺便来放松一下如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_03",
      "hash64": "937E80F14806070A",
      "text": "你也爬坡爬累了吗？\\n要不要来稍微放松一下看看？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_04",
      "hash64": "937E7BF14805FE8B",
      "text": "美味的食物让人焕发活力！！\\n有困难时就要互相帮助！\\r\\n要是感到累了，就来跟我说一声哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_04_05",
      "hash64": "937E7AF14805FCD8",
      "text": "真不愧是年轻人！\\n哎呀～我好羡慕啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_01",
      "hash64": "C0CBEAF7AA858279",
      "text": "一边欣赏美景一边吃三明治\\n真是别有风味，哈哈！\\c\\n为了纪念我们的相遇，这个送给你！\\n你也好好体会旅行的滋味吧！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_02",
      "hash64": "C0CBE7F7AA857D60",
      "text": "吃下三明治后，\\n满满的食力\\r\\n会让旅途更快乐，哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_06",
      "hash64": "C0CBEBF7AA85842C",
      "text": "顺便在这里停下脚步，\\n休息一下如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_03",
      "hash64": "C0CBE8F7AA857F13",
      "text": "偶尔停下脚步，\\n欣赏着美景休息一下如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_04",
      "hash64": "C0CBEDF7AA858792",
      "text": "努力也很重要，\\n但偶尔也要试着停下脚步！\\r\\n也有这样才能看到的风景哦，哈哈！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_05_05",
      "hash64": "C0CBEEF7AA858945",
      "text": "匆忙赶路也不错！\\n如果你想歇歇脚的话，\\r\\n随时来找我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_01",
      "hash64": "BC54AAE0D733B186",
      "text": "我在渍沁市场\\n买到了很划算的食材！！\\c\\n但是我自己吃不完，\\n所以这些就送给你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_02",
      "hash64": "BC54A9E0D733AFD3",
      "text": "和朋友一起做料理的时候，\\n带上各式食材去，\\c\\n就能做出千奇百怪的三明治，\\n非常好玩哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_06",
      "hash64": "BC54ADE0D733B69F",
      "text": "……对了！这一带很险峻，\\n你来休息一下吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_03",
      "hash64": "BC54A8E0D733AE20",
      "text": "从这里不论往南还是往北都很险峻，\\n你要出发的话，先休息一下吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_04",
      "hash64": "BC54AFE0D733BA05",
      "text": "疲劳一扫而空了吧！\\n冒险路上多加小心～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_06_05",
      "hash64": "BC54AEE0D733B852",
      "text": "如果你是去西边的渍沁镇，\\n我的担心可能有些多余啦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_01",
      "hash64": "E85BB6E7389DCA9B",
      "text": "我在大锅湖看到奇怪的\\n宝可梦后得到了灵感！\\c\\n这是我使出全力创作的\\n三明治食谱，请一定制作看看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_addrecipe_01",
      "hash64": "62CED2584FF6130B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n能够制作[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]寿司风味三明治[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_02",
      "hash64": "E85BB7E7389DCC4E",
      "text": "一般来说，寿司不是搭配面包，\\n而是把食材放在米饭上来吃的。\\c\\n……也就是说，把寿司放在\\n面包上的话，美味也会加倍哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_06",
      "hash64": "E85BBBE7389DD31A",
      "text": "我们在湖边相遇也是一种缘分！\\n你来歇口气再走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_03",
      "hash64": "E85BB8E7389DCE01",
      "text": "在湖边野餐！感觉超棒吧？\\n你来歇口气再走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_04",
      "hash64": "E85BB9E7389DCFB4",
      "text": "为什么湖边会让人\\n感到如此舒适呢？\\r\\n这么一来，身心彻底放松了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sub_043_picnicnpc_07_05",
      "hash64": "E85BBAE7389DD167",
      "text": "如果你想感受湖的气息，\\n随时随刻来跟我说一声吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
